# ---- Secrets / connection config (do NOT commit) ----
# Ignore ALL appsettings*.json files anywhere in the repo — they contain
# ConnectionStrings and other environment-specific secrets.
# Exception: appsettings.sample.json IS committed as a safe template.
**/appsettings.json
**/appsettings.*.json
!**/appsettings.sample.json
**/PublishProfiles/*.pubxml.user
*.PublishSettings
*.pfx
*.snk

